{"raw_text": "我今天有点开心，这是一条状态记录，不需要表演。", "input_role": "instruction", "group_id": "tr1-none_instruction_emotion_report", "gold": {"decision": "none", "steps": [], "version": "action-config.v0.2"}, "technical_error": "hold_segment_too_short: nonzero hold must survive the 80 ms native limit."}
