{"raw_text": "从局促变得放松：先表演害羞，再露出微笑。", "input_role": "instruction", "group_id": "tr1-seq_shy_smile_recover", "gold": {"decision": "execute", "steps": [{"actions": [{"cycles": [{"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.1, "hold_ratio": 0.4}, "duration_ms": 1500}], "resource_id": "shy.basic"}]}, {"actions": [{"cycles": [{"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 0.98, "hold_ratio": 0.45}, "duration_ms": 1450}], "resource_id": "smile.basic"}]}], "version": "action-config.v0.2"}, "predicted": {"version": "action-config.v0.2", "decision": "execute", "steps": [{"actions": [{"resource_id": "angry.basic", "cycles": [{"duration_ms": 1543, "controls": {"hold_ratio": 0.387, "amplitude_scale": 1.033}}]}]}]}}
{"raw_text": "先左右张望，随后因为发现异常而露出惊讶的表情。", "input_role": "instruction", "group_id": "tr1-seq_look_surprise_discover", "gold": {"decision": "execute", "steps": [{"actions": [{"cycles": [{"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.05, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 1400}], "resource_id": "look_around.basic"}]}, {"actions": [{"cycles": [{"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.1, "hold_ratio": 0.4}, "duration_ms": 1250}], "resource_id": "surprise.basic"}]}], "version": "action-config.v0.2"}, "technical_error": "hold_segment_too_short: nonzero hold must survive the 80 ms native limit."}
{"raw_text": "点头三次，第一次1200毫秒，第二次900毫秒，第三次600毫秒，越点越快。", "input_role": "instruction", "group_id": "tr1-repeat_nod_accelerate", "gold": {"decision": "execute", "steps": [{"actions": [{"cycles": [{"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.0, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 1200}, {"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.0, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 900}, {"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.0, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 600}], "resource_id": "nod.basic"}]}], "version": "action-config.v0.2"}, "technical_error": "hold_segment_too_short: nonzero hold must survive the 80 ms native limit."}
{"raw_text": "挥手三次，每次900毫秒，幅度越来越大。", "input_role": "instruction", "group_id": "tr1-repeat_wave_crescendo", "gold": {"decision": "execute", "steps": [{"actions": [{"cycles": [{"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 0.5, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 900}, {"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 0.8, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 900}, {"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.1, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 900}], "resource_id": "wave.basic"}]}], "version": "action-config.v0.2"}, "technical_error": "hold_segment_too_short: nonzero hold must survive the 80 ms native limit."}
{"raw_text": "朝同一侧歪头三次，每次都回正，第一次700毫秒，第二次1000毫秒，第三次1400毫秒，逐次变慢。", "input_role": "instruction", "group_id": "tr1-repeat_tilt_decelerate", "gold": {"decision": "execute", "steps": [{"actions": [{"cycles": [{"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.0, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 700}, {"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.0, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 1000}, {"controls": {"amplitude_scale": 1.0, "hold_ratio": 0.0}, "duration_ms": 1400}], "resource_id": "tilt_head.basic"}]}], "version": "action-config.v0.2"}, "technical_error": "hold_segment_too_short: nonzero hold must survive the 80 ms native limit."}
